--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 09d9dd0205bab0640872e2256248d999, type: 3}
  m_Name: M1 Battle Tutorial 1 - Deployment
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _source: {fileID: 4900000, guid: b82a08a4dbab71847b1e6c57d4c7d4b8, type: 3}
  _sourcePath: Assets/Leveraged Wars Story/2. Missions/M1-Tutorial/M1 Battle Tutorial
    1 - Deployment.md
  _warnings: []
  _lines:
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: A moment before the horn, my prince. Nobody has drawn steel yet.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: This is the only time you may choose where we stand without an enemy shoving
      back. Spend it well.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Then tell me, old friend. Where may I place them?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Within the marked ground. It is as far forward as we are allowed to set
      up.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Take hold of a troop and set it down where you want it.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Surely I may bring every sword we have.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: No, my prince. Each battle allows only so many, and whoever stays behind
      sits this one out.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Choose the ones who will earn their place.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: And what of the enemy?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Look across the field. See their horsemen on the wing?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Horsemen do not charge a line head on. They ride round and strike from
      behind. Mind that when you set ours.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Then where do my own riders go?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Out on the edge, where they have room to ride. Better you ride round them
      first than they ride round us.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Spears in the middle, where the fighting will be. Archers behind or beside,
      never in front. And nothing with its back to the enemy.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: How will I know when I am done?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: When you stop wanting to move anyone.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Then press Start Battle. The horn sounds, and after that you may give orders
      and nothing more. You cannot pick a troop up and carry it.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Then let us hope I am a quick learner.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
